{"3919340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eco Volunteer", "steam_appid": 3919340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an Inspiring Eco-Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like exploring wild places, admiring nature, and making the world cleaner? Then this game is for you! Combine leisurely walks through breathtaking landscapes with environmental care: pick up trash, help animals, and discover hidden natural wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/7adc64563cdefdccf324bbd9fa8ffd3d.poster.avif?t=1787138590\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/7adc64563cdefdccf324bbd9fa8ffd3d.webm?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/7adc64563cdefdccf324bbd9fa8ffd3d.mp4?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Clean, Protect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into vast, diverse parks, forests, and beaches that change with the seasons. Your mission isn’t just to enjoy the views—but to restore balance:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect trash (from small litter to large debris) and sort it for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue animals and people—search for lost pets and stranded hikers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph wildlife and curate a unique scrapbook.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, earn rewards, and upgrade your tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/25e8b687dd22eaaf867ed858d2fa80b0.poster.avif?t=1787138590\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/25e8b687dd22eaaf867ed858d2fa80b0.webm?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/25e8b687dd22eaaf867ed858d2fa80b0.mp4?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mindful Gameplay with Purpose</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and procedurally generated tasks—every trip into nature is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 big maps and 15+ hours of gameplay planned!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your eco-activism: buy gear, upgrade and customize your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere: listen to tranquil forest sounds, observe plants and wildlife, and snap photos for your album.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d82c7bb5b2981a737640a01af679ac51.poster.avif?t=1787138590\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d82c7bb5b2981a737640a01af679ac51.webm?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919340/extras/d82c7bb5b2981a737640a01af679ac51.mp4?t=1787138590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax and Make a Difference</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave a deeper connection with nature or dream of becoming an eco-volunteer, this game offers peace, the joy of doing good, and a chance to heal a virtual 